WEBVTT

1
00:00:02.100 --> 00:00:04.506
Open the PDF you need to sign.

2
00:00:04.906 --> 00:00:07.920
Draw your signature with your mouse or your finger.

3
00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:10.320
Click Place on page.

4
00:00:10.720 --> 00:00:14.070
Then click where the signature should go.

5
00:00:14.470 --> 00:00:18.140
Click Save PDF, and your signed copy is ready.

6
00:00:18.540 --> 00:00:21.074
Your signature never leaves your device.
